# Copy to .dev.vars for `pnpm dev`. The real values are never committed:
# .dev.vars is gitignored, and production reads them from `wrangler secret put`.
#
# A GitHub App accepts up to 10 callback URLs, so the production app can serve
# local development too: add http://localhost:8787/auth/callback alongside the
# editor.araya.dev one and reuse the same client id and secret here.
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# openssl rand -base64 32
SESSION_SECRET=
